---
import { asset } from "../../lib/assets";
import type { NarrativeProject } from "../../data/narratives";
import { n500Tracks } from "../../data/narratives";
import CapsuleAudioPlayer from "../audio/CapsuleAudioPlayer.astro";
import ColorAudioPlayer from "../audio/ColorAudioPlayer.astro";
import PlayPauseButton from "../audio/PlayPauseButton.astro";
import DoodleArrow from "./DoodleArrow.astro";
import InkMark from "./InkMark.astro";

interface Props {
  project: NarrativeProject;
  spreadIndex: number;
  side: "left" | "right";
}

const { project, spreadIndex, side } = Astro.props;
const spread = project.spreads[spreadIndex];
const page = `${spread.layout}:${side}`;
const folio = spreadIndex * 2 + (side === "left" ? 1 : 2);
const n500Artist = "Natura 500 · Banda Sonora Original";
const soundtrackColumns = side === "left" ? n500Tracks.slice(0, 4) : n500Tracks.slice(4);
const soundtrackStart = side === "left" ? 1 : 5;

const journey = [
  { name: "La ruptura", className: "journey__step--breaking" },
  { name: "La construcción", className: "journey__step--building" },
  { name: "La oportunidad", className: "journey__step--chance" },
  { name: "La escala", className: "journey__step--scale" },
  { name: "Un paso a la vez", className: "journey__step--step" },
  { name: "En lo que me convertí", className: "journey__step--becoming" },
];
---

{page === "n500-origin:left" ? (
  <article class="book-page nb-photo n500-cover">
    <img
      class="nb-photo__img"
      src={asset("/media/narratives/n-500/images/rectangle-2.webp")}
      alt="Acuarela de dos socios trabajando de noche entre computadoras, circuitos, libretas y tazas de café"
    />
    <span class="nb-tape nb-tape--tr n500-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <CapsuleAudioPlayer
      track={n500Tracks[0]}
      artist={n500Artist}
      cover={asset("/media/narratives/n-500/images/ost-cover.webp")}
      coverAlt="Portada de la banda sonora original de Natura 500"
      note="escucha 01 · el inicio del inicio"
      class="n500-cover__player"
    />
  </article>
) : page === "n500-origin:right" ? (
  <article class="book-page nb-page n500-page n500-origin">
    <span class="n500-scribble n500-scribble--corner" aria-hidden="true">///</span>
    <div class="nb-sheet n500-origin__sheet">
      <p class="nb-kicker">cuaderno 01 · el inicio del inicio</p>
      <h2 class="nb-title n500-origin__title">
        The Start of<br />a Startup
        <InkMark variant="underline-double" class="n500-origin__underline" width={2.5} />
      </h2>
      <p class="n500-origin__memory">Yo también lo recuerdo con mucha nostalgia.</p>
      <div class="nb-copy n500-origin__copy">
        <p>Pienso en dos socios sentados frente a una mesa: olor a humedad y metal, el aire pesado, las risas cuando algo por fin funcionaba.</p>
        <p>También recuerdo la disciplina, la presión y esa promesa silenciosa de no fallar. <strong class="n500-hl">Natura 500 nace desde ese recuerdo</strong>, no desde la fantasía de que todo saldrá bien.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="n500-origin__aside">un salto de fe<br />+ pizzas</p>
    </div>
    <span class="nb-folio nb-folio--right" aria-hidden="true">{folio}</span>
  </article>
) : page === "n500-remember:left" ? (
  <article class="book-page nb-page n500-page n500-remember">
    <div class="nb-sheet n500-remember__sheet">
      <p class="nb-kicker">cuaderno 02 · por qué mostrar</p>
      <h2 class="nb-title n500-remember__title">¿Por qué deben<br />ser recordadas?</h2>
      <div class="nb-copy n500-remember__copy">
        <p>Cuando una empresa trabaja a favor de la naturaleza, <strong class="n500-hl">mostrar importa todavía más.</strong></p>
        <p>Las soluciones basadas en la naturaleza atraviesan el agro, la conservación, los fármacos y el monitoreo con inteligencia artificial. Su escala no siempre se parece a la de una app, por eso su valor necesita una historia que pueda sentirse.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="nb-print n500-remember__award">
        <span class="nb-tape nb-tape--top" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <img
          src={asset("/media/narratives/n-500/images/Natural-sweetener-start-up-wins-Chivas-Venture-fund-It-s-a-bulletproof-business-model-that-benefits-all-says-CEO.webp")}
          alt="Emprendedores de impacto celebran juntos en un escenario"
        />
        <figcaption>hay valor antes de que exista un unicornio</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <span class="nb-folio nb-folio--left" aria-hidden="true">{folio}</span>
  </article>
) : page === "n500-remember:right" ? (
  <article class="book-page nb-page n500-page n500-human">
    <span class="nb-stain n500-human__stain" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="nb-sheet n500-human__sheet">
      <p class="nb-kicker">cuaderno 02 · lo humano</p>
      <h2 class="n500-human__statement">No son sólo empresas.<br /><span>Son conexiones humanas.</span></h2>
      <div class="nb-copy n500-human__copy">
        <p>Algunas están en semilla. Otras crecen, escalan o ya se consolidaron. En cada etapa hay alguien intentando que la idea sobreviva.</p>
        <p>Por eso Natura 500 no las ordena solamente: las presenta desde las personas, las tensiones y las decisiones que les dieron forma.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="n500-human__objects">
        <figure class="nb-print n500-human__portrait">
          <span class="nb-tape nb-tape--top" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <img src={asset("/media/narratives/n-500/images/rectangle-1.webp")} alt="Acuarela de un equipo de campo con las manos cubiertas de tierra" />
          <figcaption>quienes hacen que funcionen</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <ColorAudioPlayer
          track={n500Tracks[1]}
          artist={n500Artist}
          label="escucha 02 · ser recordadas"
          accent="#B84E35"
          class="n500-human__player"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="nb-folio nb-folio--right" aria-hidden="true">{folio}</span>
  </article>
) : page === "n500-journey:left" ? (
  <article class="book-page nb-page n500-page n500-journey">
    <div class="nb-sheet n500-journey__sheet">
      <p class="nb-kicker">cuaderno 03 · el viaje narrativo</p>
      <h2 class="nb-subtitle n500-journey__title">No es una línea recta.</h2>
      <div class="journey" role="img" aria-label="El viaje del emprendedor, desde la ruptura hasta en lo que me convertí">
        <svg class="journey__orbit" viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M151 28c68 0 123 54 123 121s-55 122-123 122S28 216 28 149 83 28 151 28Z" />
          <path class="journey__echo" d="M152 34c65-2 116 48 119 113 2 67-53 117-118 119-66 2-119-50-120-116C31 87 87 36 152 34Z" />
          <path class="journey__arrow" d="m257 87 17 2-5-16" />
        </svg>
        <p class="journey__center">El viaje del<br />emprendedor</p>
        {journey.map((step, index) => (
          <p class:list={["journey__step", step.className]}><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>{step.name}</p>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="n500-journey__note">Lo que vuelve al inicio ya no es la misma persona.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="nb-folio nb-folio--left" aria-hidden="true">{folio}</span>
  </article>
) : page === "n500-journey:right" ? (
  <article class="book-page nb-page n500-page n500-motion">
    <div class="nb-sheet n500-motion__sheet">
      <p class="nb-kicker">cuaderno 03 · tema principal</p>
      <div class="n500-motion__arc" aria-label="De la ruptura a la transformación">
        <p><span>...The</span> Breaking</p>
        <DoodleArrow variant="down" class="n500-motion__arrow" />
        <p><span>...The</span> Becoming</p>
      </div>
      <div class="nb-copy n500-motion__copy">
        <p>Muchas empresas terminarán. Lo irremplazable será aquello en lo que el emprendedor se convirtió: alguien más completo para dirigir, negociar, vender y diseñar.</p>
        <p>El viaje no termina cuando la empresa termina. Queda una forma distinta de mirar los problemas, tomar decisiones y volver a empezar con más herramientas que antes.</p>
      </div>
      <ColorAudioPlayer
        track={n500Tracks[5]}
        artist={n500Artist}
        label="✳ tema principal"
        accent="#275E58"
        class="n500-motion__player"
      />
      <p class="n500-motion__motto">Nada detiene este tren. Nada.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="nb-folio nb-folio--right" aria-hidden="true">{folio}</span>
  </article>
) : page === "n500-platform:left" ? (
  <article class="book-page nb-page n500-page n500-platform">
    <div class="nb-sheet n500-platform__sheet">
      <p class="nb-kicker">cuaderno 04 · la plataforma</p>
      <h2 class="nb-title n500-platform__title">No es un<br />diccionario.</h2>
      <p class="n500-platform__lede">Es el HBO de las empresas verdes y azules.</p>
      <div class="nb-copy n500-platform__copy">
        <p>Natura 500, el primer spin-off de NaturaTech LAC, busca descubrir a las empresas de América Latina y el Caribe y leerlas también desde su potencial de inversión.</p>
        <p>Entrar debe sentirse como abrir Netflix, Apple TV o HBO: cada empresa tiene un mundo, una tensión y personas que sostienen su historia.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="n500-platform__stages" aria-label="Etapas de las empresas en Natura 500">
        <span>semilla</span><span>creciendo</span><span>escalando</span><span>consolidadas</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="nb-folio nb-folio--left" aria-hidden="true">{folio}</span>
  </article>
) : page === "n500-platform:right" ? (
  <article class="book-page nb-page n500-page n500-window">
    <div class="nb-sheet n500-window__sheet">
      <p class="nb-kicker">cuaderno 04 · ver el ecosistema</p>
      <div class="n500-window__collage">
        <div class="n500-window__device">
          <div class="n500-laptop__screen">
            <img src={asset("/media/narratives/n-500/images/hero-explorer.webp")} alt="Vista de la plataforma Natura 500 mostrando el perfil de la empresa Pronaca" />
          </div>
          <span class="n500-laptop__base" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <a class="n500-window__cta" href="https://500.naturatech.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <span class="n500-window__cta-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Entrar ahora <span class="n500-window__cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <figure class="nb-print n500-window__team">
          <img src={asset("/media/narratives/n-500/images/lemu-kimal-lo-aguirre.webp")} alt="Equipo de emprendimiento verde reunido al aire libre" />
          <figcaption>y una red que abre oportunidades</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="n500-window__callout">
        <p class="n500-window__statement">Que puedan verse.<br />Que puedan sentirse.</p>
      </div>
      <CapsuleAudioPlayer
        track={n500Tracks[6]}
        artist={n500Artist}
        cover={asset("/media/narratives/n-500/images/ost-cover.webp")}
        coverAlt="Portada de la banda sonora original de Natura 500"
        note="escucha 07 · la invitación"
        class="n500-window__player"
      />
    </div>
    <span class="nb-folio nb-folio--right" aria-hidden="true">{folio}</span>
  </article>
) : (
  <article class="book-page nb-page n500-page n500-setlist" aria-label={`${side === "left" ? "Primera" : "Segunda"} parte de la banda sonora de Natura 500`}>
    <div class="nb-sheet n500-setlist__sheet">
      <div class="n500-setlist__heading">
        <p class="nb-kicker">cuaderno 05 · banda sonora</p>
        <h2>{side === "left" ? "The Breaking..." : "...The Becoming"}</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="n500-setlist__list">
        {soundtrackColumns.map((track, index) => (
          <li class:list={["n500-track", { "n500-track--main": track.id === "no-way-to-take-it-slow" }]}>
            <span class="n500-track__num" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + soundtrackStart).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
            <PlayPauseButton track={track} artist={n500Artist} class="n500-track__button" />
            <div class="n500-track__copy">
              <h3>{track.title}</h3>
              <p>{track.description}</p>
            </div>
            {track.id === "no-way-to-take-it-slow" && <span class="n500-track__badge">tema principal</span>}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      {side === "right" && <p class="n500-setlist__closing">No sé si cambió el lugar o fui yo.<br /><strong>Pero estoy en paz.</strong></p>}
    </div>
    <span class={`nb-folio nb-folio--${side}`} aria-hidden="true">{folio}</span>
  </article>
)}

<style>
  .n500-page {
    --nb-paper: oklch(0.91 0.026 85);
    --nb-ink: oklch(0.30 0.055 187);
    --nb-ink-soft: oklch(0.43 0.038 187 / 0.72);
    --nb-dot-ink: oklch(0.48 0.045 65 / 0.16);
  }

  .n500-page::before { opacity: .55; }
  .n500-page::after {
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(140% 118% at 48% 50%, transparent 58%, oklch(0.42 0.055 58 / .12) 100%),
      linear-gradient(90deg, oklch(0.38 0.04 60 / .08), transparent 6%, transparent 94%, oklch(0.38 0.04 60 / .08));
  }
  .n500-hl {
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(96deg, transparent 2%, oklch(0.72 0.13 42 / .48) 6% 94%, transparent 98%) 0 .77em / 100% .56em no-repeat;
    box-decoration-break: clone;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    padding-inline: .08em;
  }
  .n500-tape { background-color: oklch(0.80 0.07 54 / .72); }
  .n500-scribble { position: absolute; z-index: 4; color: oklch(0.55 0.12 42 / .5); font-family: var(--font-marker); }
  .n500-scribble--corner { top: 4cqw; right: 5cqw; font-size: 6cqw; rotate: 13deg; }

  /* 01 · origen */
  .n500-cover :global(.n500-cover__player) { position: absolute; z-index: 5; right: 7%; bottom: 6%; left: 8%; }
  .n500-origin__sheet { grid-template-rows: auto auto auto 1fr; }
  .n500-origin__title { position: relative; width: max-content; margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .65); color: oklch(0.35 0.08 42); font-size: 8cqw; rotate: -.7deg; }
  :global(.n500-origin__underline) { position: absolute; right: -2cqw; bottom: -1.2cqw; left: 1cqw; height: 3.4cqw; color: oklch(0.51 0.11 42); }
  .n500-origin__memory { margin: calc(var(--rule) * .8) 0 0; font-family: var(--font-marker); font-size: 4.5cqw; line-height: var(--rule); rotate: .6deg; }
  .n500-origin__copy { align-self: start; margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * 1.2); }
  .n500-origin__aside { position: absolute; right: 2.8cqw; bottom: 12cqw; margin: 0; color: oklch(0.49 0.10 42 / .72); font-family: var(--font-pen); font-size: 3.2cqw; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; rotate: -7deg; }

  /* 02 · por qué recordar */
  .n500-remember__sheet { grid-template-rows: auto auto auto minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .n500-remember__title { margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .65); font-size: 7.2cqw; color: oklch(0.34 0.075 42); rotate: -.8deg; }
  .n500-remember__copy { margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .8); font-size: 3.55cqw; }
  .n500-remember__award { align-self: end; justify-self: end; width: 78%; height: calc(var(--rule) * 6.6); padding: 2.5cqw 2.5cqw 7cqw; rotate: 1.8deg; }
  .n500-remember__award img { height: 100%; }
  .n500-remember__award figcaption { bottom: 1.7cqw; font-size: 2.9cqw; }

  .n500-human__sheet { grid-template-rows: auto auto auto 1fr; }
  .n500-human__statement { margin: calc(var(--rule) * .65) 0 0; font-family: var(--font-marker); font-size: 6.1cqw; font-weight: 400; line-height: calc(var(--rule) * 1.35); rotate: -.8deg; }
  .n500-human__statement span { color: oklch(0.49 0.11 42); }
  .n500-human__copy { margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .65); font-size: 3.35cqw; }
  .n500-human__copy p { margin-bottom: calc(var(--rule) * .55); line-height: calc(var(--rule) * .92); }
  .n500-human__objects { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.12fr) minmax(0, .88fr); align-items: end; gap: 4cqw; min-height: 0; padding-bottom: calc(var(--rule) * .5); }
  .n500-human__portrait { height: calc(var(--rule) * 8.5); padding: 2.8cqw 2.8cqw 7cqw; rotate: -1.4deg; }
  .n500-human__portrait img { height: 100%; }
  .n500-human__portrait figcaption { bottom: 1.7cqw; font-size: 2.8cqw; }
  :global(.n500-human__player) { width: calc(var(--rule) * 6.7); height: calc(var(--rule) * 6.8); min-height: 0; margin-bottom: calc(var(--rule) * .5); }
  .n500-human__stain { right: 4%; bottom: 5%; width: 28%; }

  /* 03 · círculo narrativo */
  .n500-journey__sheet { grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr auto; padding-right: 8.2cqw; }
  .n500-journey__title { margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .55); color: oklch(0.35 0.075 42); rotate: -.5deg; }
  .journey { position: relative; align-self: center; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .3); }
  .journey__orbit { position: absolute; inset: 6%; width: 88%; height: 88%; overflow: visible; fill: none; stroke: oklch(0.39 0.055 187 / .72); stroke-width: 2.3; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .journey__echo { opacity: .33; stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .journey__arrow { stroke: oklch(0.50 0.11 42); stroke-width: 3; }
  .journey__center { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; width: 30cqw; margin: 0; translate: -50% -50%; color: oklch(0.50 0.11 42); font-family: var(--font-marker); font-size: 5.2cqw; line-height: .9; text-align: center; rotate: -3deg; }
  .journey__step { position: absolute; width: 18cqw; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-pen); font-size: 3.05cqw; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; text-align: center; }
  .journey__step span { display: block; margin-bottom: .5cqw; color: oklch(0.50 0.11 42); font-size: 2.5cqw; }
  .journey__step--breaking { top: 1%; left: 41%; rotate: -2deg; }
  .journey__step--building { top: 22%; right: -2%; rotate: 2deg; }
  .journey__step--chance { right: -1%; bottom: 19%; rotate: -1deg; }
  .journey__step--scale { bottom: -1%; left: 42%; rotate: 2deg; }
  .journey__step--step { bottom: 18%; left: -2%; rotate: -3deg; }
  .journey__step--becoming { top: 21%; left: -4%; rotate: 1deg; }
  .n500-journey__note { margin: 0 auto calc(var(--rule) * .35); font-family: var(--font-marker); font-size: 3.8cqw; line-height: 1; text-align: center; rotate: -.5deg; }

  .n500-motion__sheet { grid-template-rows: auto auto auto 1fr auto; }
  .n500-motion__arc { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .65); }
  .n500-motion__arc p { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-marker); font-size: 5.2cqw; line-height: .9; }
  .n500-motion__arc p:last-child { text-align: right; }
  .n500-motion__arc span { display: block; color: oklch(0.50 0.11 42); font-size: 3cqw; }
  :global(.n500-motion__arrow) { width: 6cqw; height: 8cqw; color: oklch(0.39 0.055 187); rotate: -91deg; }
  .n500-motion__copy { margin-top: var(--rule); font-size: 3.55cqw; }
  :global(.n500-motion__player) { align-self: end; justify-self: center; width: calc(var(--rule) * 8.3); height: calc(var(--rule) * 7.4); min-height: 0; }
  .n500-motion__motto { margin: calc(var(--rule) * .6) 0 0; font-family: var(--font-marker); font-size: 4.2cqw; line-height: var(--rule); text-align: center; rotate: -.8deg; }

  /* 04 · plataforma */
  .n500-platform__sheet { grid-template-rows: auto auto auto auto 1fr; }
  .n500-platform__title { margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .65); color: oklch(0.35 0.075 42); rotate: -.9deg; }
  .n500-platform__lede { margin: calc(var(--rule) * .5) 0 0; color: oklch(0.50 0.11 42); font-family: var(--font-marker); font-size: 5cqw; line-height: var(--rule); rotate: .4deg; }
  .n500-platform__copy { margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .8); font-size: 3.55cqw; }
  .n500-platform__stages { display: flex; align-self: end; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.3cqw 1.8cqw; padding-bottom: calc(var(--rule) * .5); }
  .n500-platform__stages span { border: 1.3px solid oklch(0.39 0.055 187 / .6); border-radius: 50%; padding: 1.1cqw 2.3cqw; font-family: var(--font-pen); font-size: 3cqw; font-weight: 700; rotate: -1deg; }
  .n500-platform__stages span:nth-child(even) { rotate: 2deg; }

  .n500-window__sheet { grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto auto; }
  .n500-window__collage { position: relative; min-height: 0; margin-top: calc(var(--rule) * .4); }
  .n500-window__device { position: absolute; top: 3%; left: 1%; z-index: 1; width: 80%; rotate: -1.5deg; filter: drop-shadow(0 2.2cqw 1.8cqw oklch(0.29 0.035 187 / .2)); }
  .n500-laptop__screen { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid oklch(0.20 0.025 187); border-bottom-width: 3px; border-radius: 2.3cqw 2.3cqw .7cqw .7cqw; background: oklch(0.19 0.022 187); padding: 3.2cqw 2.1cqw 2cqw; }
  .n500-laptop__screen::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 1.15cqw; left: 50%; z-index: 2; width: 1.05cqw; aspect-ratio: 1; translate: -50% 0; border: 1px solid oklch(0.55 0.02 187); border-radius: 50%; background: oklch(0.11 0.02 187); box-shadow: 0 0 0 .45cqw oklch(0.26 0.02 187); }
  .n500-laptop__screen::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 3.2cqw 2.1cqw 2cqw; border-radius: .7cqw; background: linear-gradient(118deg, oklch(0.98 0.01 90 / .17), transparent 29%); pointer-events: none; }
  .n500-laptop__screen img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1280 / 832; border: 1px solid oklch(0.58 0.02 187 / .45); border-radius: .7cqw; object-fit: cover; }
